'''Giant Isopod''' is a {{Rarity|m|nolink=y}} [[Sea Creature]] that can be fished up from water exclusively on the [[Torrhus Canyon]].

== Spawning ==
'''Giant Isopod''' can be fished up from water in [[Torrhus Canyon]]. It requires {{skl|fishing|level XV (15)}} or higher to be fished up.

The base [[Sea Creatures#Sea Creature Weight|Weight]] for '''Giant Isopod''' is {{Green|25}}, resulting in a default catch chance of {{Chance|0.25%|1|400|sea creatures}} with all Sea Creatures unlocked. Certain modifiers can be used to increase it:

