== Behavior ==
When caught, the '''Giant Isopod''' spawns atop the {{zone|Torrhus Springs}}, regardless of its catch location. It will indiscriminately attack players in its vicinity. Upon being damaged to half  {{Stat|HP}}, the '''Giant Isopod''' travels down the [[Torrhus Springs]] all the way to the [[Desert Temple]] at the bottom, similarly to the {{MobSprite|Nessie}}, and begins to fight players again once it has arrived. It is completely invulnerable during its journey down.

